# Rust product door — do not extend native

New Metabolic Forest features (APIs, rules, search, sampling, conjugation
helpers, CLI, etc.) land in:

1. `crates/xenosite-forest/` (Rust chematic engine)
2. `src/xenosite/forest/` public wrapper (`__init__.py`, `_ext.py` — PyO3)

**Do not** implement or back-port those features into:

- `src/xenosite/forest/native/` — RDKit reference; **feature-frozen** (see `docs/forest/NATIVE.md`)
- `src/xenosite/forest/legacy/` — frozen 0.6.x archive (see `docs/forest/LEGACY.md`)

Native/legacy edits are allowed only for parity bugfixes, CI, or docs that
restate this freeze — and only when explicitly asked. Prefer Rust when unsure.
